      "m_dialogList": {
        "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
        "m_dialogs": [
          {
            "m_dialogTag": "Completion",
            "m_dialogEntries": [
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "KT-HUB-NPC19_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Gah... oh, you again. Remember me? I'm Qhatlady, not Copy Qhat. We're making a spell together.",
                "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Cat_CabalistF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Qhatlady_DM-SPELL_017.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1704303,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "KT-HUB-NPC19_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Smart aleck.",
                "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Cat_CabalistF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Qhatlady_DM-SPELL_018.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1704303,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "KT-HUB-NPC19_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Ah, yes, these Photomances of Pingouinonia rejuvenated do indeed show the turning of the wheel. One wonders if it will ever turn back around.",
                "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Cat_CabalistF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Qhatlady_DM-SPELL_019.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1704303,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "KT-HUB-NPC19_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "And from what you describe, it seems you had the necessary experience in the fallen empire of Karamelle.",
                "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Cat_CabalistF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Qhatlady_DM-SPELL_020.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1704303,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "KT-HUB-NPC19_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Curious how both times, it was your hand that spun fate around. Hmm. Our spell has shape and energy; now all it needs is Balance.",
                "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Cat_CabalistF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Qhatlady_DM-SPELL_021.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1704303,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "KT-HUB-NPC19_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Thus we are here, near the nexus of Selenopolis, in the world where Balance Magic was born. Focus here on your magic and your memories.",
                "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Cat_CabalistF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Qhatlady_DM-SPELL_022.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1704303,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "KT-HUB-NPC19_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Call the Wheel of Fortune into being and imprint it onto a Spell Card.",
                "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Cat_CabalistF_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Qhatlady_DM-SPELL_023.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1704303,
