  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-CAMP-NPC28_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "GAAH! Oh, wait, wait, it's you. Me? I'm Qhatlady. No, NOT Copy Qhat. Qhatlady. Very different person. We fought in Sepidious, remember?",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Cat_CabalistF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Qhatlady_DM-SPELL_001.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1704303,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-CAMP-NPC28_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "NO! AHHH, fine. Then I don't remember you either. I was deployed by the Arcanum to find a certain wayward Wizard and see if they are okay.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Cat_CabalistF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Qhatlady_DM-SPELL_002.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1704303,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-CAMP-NPC28_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "So if you see any absentminded Wizards, tell them to stay okay and- wait, hmmm... what is that?",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Cat_CabalistF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Qhatlady_DM-SPELL_003.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1704303,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-CAMP-NPC28_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I've heard of those cards! I once met an Outsider named Veda? Vada? Vadi-something... she told me of this ancient magic. The Cabal toyed with it for years.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Cat_CabalistF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Qhatlady_DM-SPELL_004.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1704303,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-CAMP-NPC28_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "We came up with a ritual to sort of absorb experience over a short time and concentrate it into a new Spell. Couldn't make it work.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Cat_CabalistF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Qhatlady_DM-SPELL_005.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1704303,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-CAMP-NPC28_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "But maybe we just need one of these cards as a base. If only there was some Wizard who remembered fighting me in Empyrea I could recruit to help.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Cat_CabalistF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Qhatlady_DM-SPELL_006.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1704303,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-CAMP-NPC28_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "If there were, I would tell them such a spell would need a shape, positive energy, negative energy and elemental infusion.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Cat_CabalistF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Qhatlady_DM-SPELL_007.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1704303,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-CAMP-NPC28_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "If this completely hypothetical Wizard were interested, I would tell them to grab a card from that table to give the spell its shape.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Cat_CabalistF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Qhatlady_DM-SPELL_008.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1704303,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
